[5.878439, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  \u001b[38;5;252msymbols and one existing focused test\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mthat directly asserts empty\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mforwarded_input. Then suggest one small\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252madditional assertion.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;147m\r\n●\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1mTrace SSH wheel ownership\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  railmux ssh — agent-pane wheel served\u001b[K\r\n  locally, not forwarded upstream:\u001b[K\r\n  1. handle_terminal_part gets the\u001b[K\r\n  SgrMouseEvent and dispatches to\u001b[K\r\n  LocalHistoryView.wheel.\u001b[K\r\n  2. wheel() resolves the pane via\u001b[K\r\n  _route_at; a hit on an agent viewport\u001b[K\r\n  scrolls _HistoryViewport.offset and\u001b[K\r\n  returns HistoryAction with\u001b[K\r\n  render_history=True and\u001b[K\r\n  forwarded_input=b\"\" — no upstream input.\u001b[K\r\n  3. apply_history_action only sends\u001b[K\r\n  upstream when action.forwarded_input is\u001b[K\r\n  set; empty means nothing reaches tmux. The\u001b[K\r\n  overlay is painted client-side via\u001b[K\r\n  surface.paint_overlays.\u001b[K\r\n  4. This is a fast-client history overlay\u001b[K\r\n  over bounded snapshots, not tmux copy-\u001b[K\r\n  mode; the implementation notes stock tmux\u001b[K\r\n  WheelUpPane would enter copy-mode, which\u001b[K\r\n  is deliberately avoided.\u001b[K\r\n  Focused test: tests/test_fast_full_window.\u001b[K\r\n  py::test_local_history_routes_sidebar_imme\u001b[K\r\n  diately_and_owns_agent_wheel asserts\u001b[K\r\n  agent_action.forwarded_input == b\"\".\u001b[K\r\n  Suggested addition: assert\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\r\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[38;5;147m\u001b[34;1H❯\u001b[39m \u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\r\n──────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[38;5;244m\u001b[36;1H  ⏵⏵ normal mode · shift+tab to cycle · ← for agents\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[30m\u001b[48;5;70m\r\n[R]\u0